# Sustainable Development Commitment

This scope determines if the application of the Economic Partnership Agreement fully accounts for human, cultural, economic, social, health, and environmental best interests, while also adhering to principles of ownership, participation, and dialogue.

```catala
declaration scope SustainableDevelopmentCheck:
  input agreement_applies content boolean
  input human_interests content boolean
  input cultural_interests content boolean
  input economic_interests content boolean
  input social_interests content boolean
  input health_interests content boolean
  input environmental_interests content boolean
  input future_generations content boolean
  input ownership_principle content boolean
  input participation_principle content boolean
  input dialogue_principle content boolean
  output is_sustainable content boolean
```

## Sustainable Development Commitment

The commitment is met if the agreement applies and all listed best interests and fundamental principles are fully accounted for.

```catala
scope SustainableDevelopmentCheck:
  date round down
  definition is_sustainable equals
    (agreement_applies) and
    (human_interests) and
    (cultural_interests) and
    (economic_interests) and
    (social_interests) and
    (health_interests) and
    (environmental_interests) and
    (future_generations) and
    (ownership_principle) and
    (participation_principle) and
    (dialogue_principle)
```